WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for media/ingot-intro.mp4.

The text is video/ingot-intro/SCRIPT.md verbatim. The timings are the composition's own
frame starts from video/ingot-intro/index.html (data-start), which are the cumulative
voice-clip durations in video/ingot-intro/audio_meta.json — not the planned budget in
SCRIPT.md, which runs to 51s against a finished cut of 37.47s. Two long lines are split
